actions / general
  core.abort    Abort    Ends the workflow as failed
  core.dummy    Dummy    Does nothing; collects branches into one point
  core.log      Log      Writes a message to the run log
  core.start    Start    Entry point of the workflow
  core.success  Success  Ends the workflow successfully
  core.wait     Wait     Waits for a given time
actions / execution
  core.run-pipeline  Run Pipeline  Runs a pipeline with parameters; output: the counts of its transforms
  core.run-workflow  Run Workflow  Runs another workflow with parameters; output: its outputs
actions / files
  file.copy    Copy Files     Copies files or folders; output: the copied files
  file.delete  Delete Files   Deletes files or folders; output: the deleted paths
  file.exists  File Exists    Checks whether files or folders exist; output: the matching paths
  file.list    List Files     Lists the files of a folder; output: path, name, size, modified and folder of each entry
  file.mkdir   Create Folder  Creates a folder with its parent folders; output: the path
  file.move    Move Files     Moves files or folders; output: the new paths
  file.wait    Wait for File  Waits until files exist; output: the matching paths
transforms / input
  core.generate-rows  Generate Rows  Creates records with constant fields
  csv.input           CSV Input      Reads the rows of a CSV file as records
transforms / transform
  core.constant       Add Constants  Adds fields with the same value to every record
  core.convert        Convert Types  Converts fields to another type, with a number or date format
  core.filter         Filter         Passes on the records for which a condition is true
  core.select-fields  Select Fields  Keeps, orders and renames fields, or removes fields
transforms / flow
  core.dummy   Dummy   Passes all records on unchanged
  core.switch  Switch  Passes each record to the link of the first case whose condition is true
transforms / execution
  core.from-result  Records from Workflow  Passes on the records the calling workflow gave to the pipeline (rows)
  core.to-result    Records to Workflow    Returns the records to the calling workflow (output.rows) and passes them on
transforms / combine
  core.group-by  Group By  Combines records with the same values into one, with count, sum and other aggregates
  core.sort      Sort      Sorts the records by fields; keeps all records in memory
transforms / output
  core.log    Log         Writes records to the run log and passes them on
  csv.output  CSV Output  Writes records to a CSV file and passes them on
